WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:03.680
Nine at night. You open Certuvo.

00:00:03.680 --> 00:00:08.520
Thousands of verified questions are already
there, aligned to your syllabus.

00:00:09.070 --> 00:00:12.370
You start with a timed quiz. Twenty minutes.

00:00:12.370 --> 00:00:16.070
Later in the week, the full mock, at the real
length.

00:00:16.620 --> 00:00:20.230
You get one wrong. The explanation is right
there.

00:00:20.230 --> 00:00:24.780
Still not sure? Ask for help on that question.
That one.

00:00:25.330 --> 00:00:29.120
So you call your AI Coach, and keep pacing.

00:00:29.120 --> 00:00:33.720
It's reading your screen. You never describe a
thing.

00:00:34.270 --> 00:00:38.560
Your cohort is in a study room. You join for
twenty minutes.

00:00:38.560 --> 00:00:43.020
What you learn goes into your notes, beside
the question.

00:00:43.570 --> 00:00:47.430
Certuvo has been watching one thing all
evening.

00:00:47.430 --> 00:00:53.070
The same gap, three nights running. Now you
know.

00:00:53.620 --> 00:00:56.700
Progress up. Streak intact.

00:00:56.700 --> 00:01:00.260
Tomorrow, the same place. Certuvo.
